<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"fontStyle":"normal","fontWeight":"600"}},"fontFamily":"system-font"} -->
<p class="has-system-font-font-family" style="font-style:normal;font-weight:600">At <strong>River’s Edge Web Development</strong>, we believe that a truly successful website is one that everyone can use. With digital accessibility lawsuits hitting record highs in 2025, ensuring your site meets <strong>WCAG 2.1 Level AA</strong> standards is no longer just a "nice-to-have"—it is a legal and ethical necessity. We provide comprehensive ADA scans to uncover hidden barriers like missing screen-reader labels, poor color contrast, and broken keyboard navigation.</p>
